{
  "$doc": "\u00a723.6 ST-5 (\u00a723.6g). Merge (\u00a716b, D-P7, F-23): beyond band + lead + margin (400 + 200 + 200 = 800 m), quiet for 30 s, UNOBSERVED and with no man in CONTACT; then BusResolutionSwitch.Merge sums each child back (X-4) - a slot with no child is down. No resolution policy (the R-8336 workaround is gone, R-8350). The second split is the instructor's pin, a do-set of AggregateUnit.Pin = PinPhysical (SV-14). Children by NAME <platoon>/<composite slot> (F-22, R-8349), listed in `later`; the same names come back on the second split. \u26a0 Measured (\u00a723.6d): a few whole men come back slightly hurt from their time as soldiers; the rows judge the losses (3 down, never a 4th, 27 up, the 2 hurt still hurt), not exact health.",
