      "who": "Blue Stochastic Platoon",
      "path": "AggregateUnit.Resolution",
      "op": "==",
      "value": "Physical",
      "before": 15
    },
    {
      "name": "merged back: contact ends (the patrol walks away past the merge line, 800 m, and 30 s pass unobserved), the men merge",
